1
00:00:04,366 --> 00:00:05,166
Doesn't look good

2
00:00:05,800 --> 00:00:06,600
Looks good

3
00:00:09,233 --> 00:00:10,066
No need to be nervous

4
00:00:12,200 --> 00:00:13,200
I'm not nervous

5
00:00:13,300 --> 00:00:14,100
Then what is it

6
00:00:14,400 --> 00:00:15,600
I just find it interesting

7
00:00:16,200 --> 00:00:18,100
The whole city used to laugh at me

8
00:00:18,266 --> 00:00:19,766
Now it's the Fu family branch's turn

9
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:22,500
No one has the right to laugh at you

10
00:00:23,166 --> 00:00:24,400
Don't speak too soon

11
00:00:24,866 --> 00:00:26,700
The more entitled some people feel

12
00:00:26,800 --> 00:00:28,300
The harder the slap in the face will be later

13
00:00:28,300 --> 00:00:30,433
Wenyao watch your words tonight

14
00:00:30,566 --> 00:00:31,800
I know Dad

15
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:33,600
Randomly picking someone at the wedding

16
00:00:33,600 --> 00:00:35,300
And getting the Fu family heir

17
00:00:35,466 --> 00:00:37,000
Everyone praises his good taste

18
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:39,100
But I think he's just lucky

19
00:00:39,100 --> 00:00:40,766
I heard he was originally engaged to the Gu family

20
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:42,366
And only switched partners on the wedding day

21
00:00:42,366 --> 00:00:43,400
Such a coincidence

22
00:00:44,633 --> 00:00:45,466
Ah

23
00:00:55,066 --> 00:00:57,466
Chen Zhou Mingyao come here

24
00:00:58,633 --> 00:01:00,000
Let me introduce you to everyone
